<title>PHILIPPINES: Asia Trust 6-mths net 102.261 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Asia Trust 6-mths net 102.261 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine private development bank Asiatrust Development Bank said on Thursday it made a net income of 102.261 million pesos in the six months ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The bank, with a financial year beginning July 1, was listed on the Philippine Stock Exchange last October.</p>
<p>The bank did not give the comparative year-go net profit figure or revenue figures.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
